To enter Wizard mode on single user systems:

nethack -uwizard -D

Then, you can get help on wizard commands, by typing / then j

Some ones that I remember now:

^T  Teleport
^V  Teleport Level
^W  Wish  (These wishes aren't limited like wand of wishing wishes are, they
           always work.  Try a blessed +50 broad sword named Stormbringer)
^I  Identify



